From e4edecadfc5491baf0453469072a88fab035c52f Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: =?UTF-8?q?Micha=C5=82=20=C5=BBygowski?= <michal.zygowski@3mdeb.com>
Date: Wed, 27 Nov 2024 00:13:07 +0100
Subject: [PATCH] nb/amd/pi/00730F01: Set IoapicSbFeatureEn from _PIC hook
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

Per family 16h models 30h-3fh BKDG the IoapicSbFeatureEn must be
configured according to the interrupt routing mode selected by OS.
If OS chose APIC mode, the IoapicSbFeatureEn must be cleared.
Otherwise, it must be set, meaning PIC mode is used.

ACPI specification says that _PIC method is optional and can be
called by OSPM to provide the interrupt routing mode information to
the firmware. However, if the method is not called, the firmware
must assume PIC mode is used. AGESA sets the IoapicSbFeatureEn
already to be compliant with ACPI. Previously, coreboot cleared the
bit unconditionally and left a comment to move that part to DSDT.

Implement the \_SB.NAPE hook, which the common _PIC method calls after
storing the OS choice in PICM, to set or clear IoapicSbFeatureEn
accordingly.

Upstream-Status: Pending
Signed-off-by: Michał Żygowski <michal.zygowski@3mdeb.com>

diff --git a/src/northbridge/amd/pi/00730F01/acpi/northbridge.asl b/src/northbridge/amd/pi/00730F01/acpi/northbridge.asl
index 5cecbfb9f163..8abc4c8b3224 100644
--- a/src/northbridge/amd/pi/00730F01/acpi/northbridge.asl
+++ b/src/northbridge/amd/pi/00730F01/acpi/northbridge.asl
@@ -6,6 +6,38 @@ External (TOM2)
 Name(_HID, EISAID("PNP0A08"))	/* PCI Express Root Bridge */
 Name(_CID, EISAID("PNP0A03"))	/* PCI Root Bridge */
 
+OperationRegion (NAPC, PCI_Config, 0xF8, 0x08)
+Field (NAPC, DWordAcc, NoLock, Preserve)
+{
+	NAPX,   32,	/* Northbridge IOAPIC Index */
+	NAPD,   32	/* Northbridge IOAPIC Data */
+}
+
+IndexField (NAPX, NAPD, DWordAcc, NoLock, Preserve)
+{
+	NAFC,   32	/* Northbridge IOAPIC Feature Control */
+}
+
+Mutex (NAPM, 0x00)
+
+/* Called from _PIC after PICM is updated with the OS' IRQ routing choice */
+Method (\_SB.NAPE, 0, NotSerialized)
+{
+	Acquire (\_SB.PCI0.NAPM, 0xFFFF)
+
+	Local0 = \_SB.PCI0.NAFC
+	Local0 &= 0xFFFFFFEF /* Clear IoapicSbFeatureEn for APIC mode */
+
+	/* Set IoapicSbFeatureEn if OS chose to use PIC mode */
+	If (PICM == 0) {
+		Local0 |= (1 << 4)
+	}
+
+	\_SB.PCI0.NAFC = Local0
+
+	Release (\_SB.PCI0.NAPM)
+}
+
 /* Describe the Northbridge devices */
 
 Method(_BBN, 0, NotSerialized)	/* Bus number = 0 */
